{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"It has been a few days since I have had the first quiet hour in which I am alone and can continue the account of my journey to you, my dear. On Friday we visited the battlefield of Waterloo in a carriage, and I saw here these eternally memorable fields, hills, and points—especially the high, wooded hill stood out to me, from which one can see many miles in every direction, where Napoleon, the prince of battles, had set up his throne, which he lost here! In the stifling midday heat we walked for three to four hours on the paths, where under every clod of earth brave men lie buried. On Saturday we saw the picture gallery, strolled in the park, visited St. Gudula’s Church, and examined its beautiful windows—the most beautiful I have ever seen—its paintings, marble statues, and so on. Then in the evening we went to Laeken Palace—a pleasant walk and a nice spot. On Sunday morning was spent with going out, visiting churches, shopping for you, my dear, and packing, and at half past two o’clock we drove together—Mr. van Ghert had the kindness, and coincidentally also, as a convalescent from an illness, the leisure to accompany me—to Ghent. Here we saw the beautiful cathedral, some other churches, and then attended the act of the handover of the rectorship of the university, which lasted until one o’clock, then quickly ate lunch, and at half past three o’clock drove here in a carriage, where we arrived yesterday after ten o’clock, just opposite from here, on the other bank of the Scheldt."}}],"created":1795220590,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":342,"prompt_tokens":476,"total_tokens":818,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-zqJY3GwglSnVvzbPdWUdujjQKQDN0Xhe","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":476,"prompt_ms":543.141,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.1410525210084033,"prompt_per_second":876.3838487611873,"predicted_n":342,"predicted_ms":7969.596,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.37124926686217,"predicted_per_second":42.787614328254534}}